Android's cRFireWork::Shoot (00075b6c) draws a second lifetime for each
particle. cRFade::Start and StartOn (0004a5b0, 0004a598) advance immediately.
Fade AI (0004a40c) waits for a rendered black frame and then the new screen;
its FadeIn (0003e0b0) holds black for three ticks before revealing the screen.
The port's Options and Exit screens also release the fade when they are ready.

